WEBVTT

00:01.110 --> 00:02.480
Wh-What is that?

00:02.480 --> 00:04.480
That's a dark spirit?

00:04.990 --> 00:06.320
A-A pillar?

00:10.840 --> 00:12.880
Get back, Flanril!

00:21.170 --> 00:22.660
No!

00:29.300 --> 00:34.420
<i>That world I had always envisioned</i>

00:34.420 --> 00:38.070
<i>Could I have found it?</i>

00:46.940 --> 00:51.560
<i>I lived my days at someone 
else's convenience</i>

00:51.980 --> 00:56.190
<i>Gaining nothing but compromises and regrets</i>

00:56.190 --> 00:58.330
<i>Because I always felt that</i>

00:58.330 --> 01:02.220
<i>Even if it wasn't me standing here</i>

01:02.220 --> 01:06.260
<i>The world would still keep moving forward</i>

01:06.260 --> 01:10.060
<i>Even after I lost it</i>

01:10.060 --> 01:12.340
<i>And its colors faded</i>

01:12.340 --> 01:16.420
<i>The dream from that hazily remembered day</i>

01:16.420 --> 01:18.380
<i>Still remained</i>

01:18.380 --> 01:20.810
<i>The thing that only I can do</i>

01:20.810 --> 01:23.530
<i>And the scenery that I left behind</i>

01:23.530 --> 01:31.050
<i>I was just looking for an answer 
from some other time</i>

01:32.380 --> 01:37.240
<i>Those things that don't change</i>

01:37.240 --> 01:42.820
<i>And those words I protected so carefully</i>

01:42.820 --> 01:47.460
<i>Even if they're all just 
unattractive junk to others</i>

01:47.460 --> 01:55.860
<i>They're all treasures 
that I will never give up</i>

02:11.520 --> 02:13.040
Come into union.

02:13.040 --> 02:15.610
My feelings dwell within blood crystals!

02:16.440 --> 02:17.230
Idiot!

02:17.230 --> 02:18.200
My ear doesn't matter!

02:18.200 --> 02:19.160
Yes, it does!

02:19.160 --> 02:20.610
You'll die too!

02:21.650 --> 02:23.120
If we're together, then it's fine!

02:29.240 --> 02:30.200
Run!

02:39.930 --> 02:41.300
Armored Warrior?

02:42.820 --> 02:44.560
Such overwhelming power.

02:49.640 --> 02:50.640
<i>That ninja...</i>

02:51.190 --> 02:54.600
<i>His party used themselves as sacrifices 
to summon a dark spirit?</i>

02:56.600 --> 02:57.610
Saitou!

02:57.610 --> 02:59.610
Do we only have one tower shield?

02:59.870 --> 03:03.000
How could we carry more than 
one of those things?

03:12.100 --> 03:13.040
Morlock-san!

03:13.040 --> 03:14.890
The Seven Thunder Gods!

03:14.890 --> 03:15.950
All right.

03:17.670 --> 03:19.260
Seven thunderbolts in formation!

03:19.260 --> 03:21.340
Six blasts, five swords, four spears!

03:21.340 --> 03:24.220
Three are my fangs! Two are...

03:24.660 --> 03:26.230
T-Two are...

03:28.600 --> 03:29.730
Arms!

03:30.140 --> 03:31.500
...m-my arms!

03:31.500 --> 03:33.350
These words unleashed by my mind...

03:33.350 --> 03:35.100
shall become blades of lightning!

03:35.100 --> 03:36.780
Explode, Thunder Gods!

03:58.760 --> 03:59.890
Did we do it?

04:15.810 --> 04:17.110
It's unscathed.

04:38.560 --> 04:39.800
Aim for the eyes!

04:40.720 --> 04:42.420
If magic doesn't work...

04:45.030 --> 04:46.170
Damn!

04:54.190 --> 04:56.230
With this kind of firepower,
 we can't get close!

05:05.320 --> 05:06.360
This is bad!

05:06.360 --> 05:08.280
Once I run out of magical energy, 
I won't be able to block this!

05:09.520 --> 05:11.870
Morlock-san, we should do that one.

05:12.230 --> 05:13.620
That one? Which is that?

05:14.240 --> 05:16.250
The magic that stops time.

05:16.530 --> 05:18.720
Saitou, how do you...

05:18.720 --> 05:21.630
No, but... you didn't see it.

05:21.630 --> 05:23.050
No, I did see it.

05:23.600 --> 05:26.620
Back then, in the locked book of magic.

05:27.630 --> 05:29.800
It was made to look 
like something important,

05:29.800 --> 05:31.400
but inside there was only a mushroom...

05:30.600 --> 05:32.180
<b>This is a mushroom!!</b>

05:32.430 --> 05:36.320
That's what you wanted people to think, 
but there was actually a false bottom.

05:37.180 --> 05:40.310
And there was parchment inside.

05:40.600 --> 05:44.430
Magic that controls space and time?

05:44.430 --> 05:45.570
Is that...

05:47.580 --> 05:49.320
You old geezer...

05:49.720 --> 05:50.920
Don't kill him!

05:55.200 --> 05:56.410
Morlock-san...

05:56.410 --> 06:00.420
It was you who called me 
to this world, wasn't it?

06:03.960 --> 06:07.420
<b>The Foolish Wizard 
Who Wished 
to Turn Back Time</b>

06:07.640 --> 06:10.890
Ck... Ro... M...

06:11.380 --> 06:14.390
Ckrom? Crome?

06:14.930 --> 06:17.860
Could it be that you put
my name on this necklace?

06:17.860 --> 06:18.760
Yes!

06:19.960 --> 06:21.440
Well, this is amazing!

06:21.440 --> 06:23.730
I can't wait to see what your future holds!

06:29.660 --> 06:32.950
<b>The genius magician Morlock had a daughter</b>

06:33.300 --> 06:36.810
Father, can you stay at home today?

06:36.810 --> 06:37.730
What?

06:37.730 --> 06:41.310
No, I have to go to the magic research lab.

06:42.420 --> 06:44.790
Oh. I see.

06:44.790 --> 06:49.370
Your dad is going to become 
the greatest magician in the land.

06:49.370 --> 06:54.290
When that happens, you'll be able to 
live even more happily than you do now.

06:54.290 --> 06:56.040
Yeah, that's true.

06:56.040 --> 06:57.690
Oh, you're such a good girl.

07:04.280 --> 07:07.110
Mother, is Father...

07:07.110 --> 07:08.980
is Father here yet?

07:08.980 --> 07:11.150
He'll be home soon.

07:11.150 --> 07:12.960
You go to sleep.

07:11.840 --> 07:15.740
I want to hurry... hurry up and get better...

07:15.740 --> 07:19.790
so I can make another one... a necklace.

07:19.790 --> 07:21.760
Yes, that's right.

07:39.640 --> 07:40.760
Dear?

07:40.760 --> 07:44.030
Oh, I only came back 
to fetch some materials.

07:44.420 --> 07:45.940
I'll be leaving right away.

07:45.940 --> 07:49.440
Our girl is having 
fevers almost every night.

07:49.440 --> 07:54.030
Could you stay at home a little more, 
in case the worst happens?

07:54.030 --> 07:55.750
She'll be fine.

07:55.750 --> 07:58.870
I've had a word with both 
the medical clinic and the temple.

07:58.870 --> 07:59.780
But...

08:00.120 --> 08:03.640
I'm on the verge of being 
recognized as a great mage!

08:03.640 --> 08:07.950
If I don't give it my all now, then all
my hard work will have been in vain!

08:10.080 --> 08:14.380
Once I become a great mage, 
we'll be able to live in a better house.

08:14.730 --> 08:16.960
Wouldn't you be proud of it, too?

08:18.330 --> 08:21.120
She's been waiting...

08:21.120 --> 08:22.930
waiting all this time for you to come home.

08:28.790 --> 08:32.190
Tomorrow, I'll try 
to come home as soon as I can.

08:46.220 --> 08:48.500
I've done it! I did it!

08:48.500 --> 08:50.710
I'm finally a great mage!

08:50.710 --> 08:54.250
The most prominent magicians 
in the land have acknowledged me!

08:59.830 --> 09:01.530
Last night...

09:01.530 --> 09:05.010
she suddenly got a fever higher 
than her usual ones.

09:05.010 --> 09:07.140
And even though I took her 
to the medical clinic...

09:07.140 --> 09:09.830
there wasn't anyone there 
in the middle of the night.

09:11.600 --> 09:13.900
By dawn, she was unconscious.

09:18.760 --> 09:21.200
What about the church? Revival magic?

09:21.200 --> 09:23.760
We should still have a few gold coins!

09:24.400 --> 09:26.320
That's all we have.

09:28.400 --> 09:31.460
It's barely enough to buy tomorrow's bread.

09:32.200 --> 09:34.940
We don't have nearly enough 
to pay the church.

09:35.850 --> 09:39.970
Is it because of what 
I've invested in the lab?

09:40.580 --> 09:42.760
If you'd been home,

09:42.760 --> 09:45.740
you might have been able to 
save her with magic.

09:46.760 --> 09:47.720
Our girl...

09:48.240 --> 09:51.230
until the very last moment, 
she held on to this.

09:53.880 --> 09:56.990
Even after she'd lost consciousness, 
she gripped it so tightly.

09:56.990 --> 10:01.740
Even though you've never 
once worn it for her.

10:32.630 --> 10:34.950
I couldn't save my daughter...

10:35.190 --> 10:37.360
How is that a "great mage"?

10:55.120 --> 10:58.180
"Regarding magic which 
can manipulate time..."?

10:59.360 --> 11:00.710
Northern kingdom?

11:01.130 --> 11:02.560
Great labyrinth?

11:02.560 --> 11:06.730
"Magic which can manipulate time 
sleeps within the depths of..."

11:21.110 --> 11:24.030
Am I right in thinking 
that this is the great labyrinth?

11:24.030 --> 11:26.920
Yes. Are you from a foreign land?

11:26.920 --> 11:29.790
I think exploring alone 
would be ill-advised.

11:29.790 --> 11:31.150
I'll be fine.

11:49.980 --> 11:54.010
Magical camouflage and sealing magic.

11:54.980 --> 11:58.280
Magic, begone! Return to
 where you rightfully belong!

12:14.870 --> 12:17.560
Wh-What is this place?

12:24.590 --> 12:26.130
This is...

12:27.100 --> 12:28.410
Oh dear...

12:30.500 --> 12:32.510
"Magic to stop time."

12:33.010 --> 12:36.260
"Magic to make contact with another world."

12:36.260 --> 12:37.350
Blast it!

12:37.350 --> 12:40.520
Why isn't there any magic here 
that turns back time?

12:51.950 --> 12:54.520
It was you who wrote this, wasn't it?

12:55.450 --> 12:58.190
Please, teach me magic 
that will turn back time.

12:58.530 --> 12:59.960
Why?

13:00.250 --> 13:02.960
I want to bring my dead daughter back.

13:03.380 --> 13:06.600
If you can beat me, then I won't
 mind granting your wish.

13:08.100 --> 13:09.390
All right.

13:15.060 --> 13:17.980
<i>A being who surpasses human understanding.</i>

13:17.980 --> 13:21.360
<i>In a fight, there's a ninety 
percent chance I'll be killed,</i>

13:21.360 --> 13:25.200
<i>but even if that's true...</i>

13:32.880 --> 13:34.550
Seven thunderbolts in formation!

13:34.550 --> 13:36.830
Six blasts, five swords, four spears!

13:36.830 --> 13:39.460
Three are my fangs! Two are my arms!

13:39.460 --> 13:42.960
These words unleashed by my mind 
shall become blades of lightning!

13:42.960 --> 13:44.460
Explode, Thunder Gods!

14:05.160 --> 14:06.820
You're impressive.

14:06.820 --> 14:09.950
I've already grown tired of this world,

14:09.950 --> 14:13.200
but I'm glad that I was able to 
fight someone like you here at the end.

14:14.570 --> 14:16.840
W-Wait...

14:16.840 --> 14:19.250
I'm journeying to another world.

14:19.960 --> 14:23.960
In honor of your brave fight, 
I shall grant a little of your wish.

14:23.960 --> 14:27.100
Th-Then, turn back...

14:27.100 --> 14:29.920
You don't really need 
to turn back time, do you?

14:30.350 --> 14:31.970
Not if you forget.

14:32.930 --> 14:35.630
You just want to feel better.

14:35.630 --> 14:39.180
If you forget your daughter, 
then things will be easier.

14:39.980 --> 14:43.320
From this point on, 
you should live a new life.

14:43.320 --> 14:46.910
Happily, you will forget 
the sins you've committed as well.

15:02.240 --> 15:04.280
Gramps, you all right?

15:04.280 --> 15:06.380
I did tell you it was ill-advised.

15:07.010 --> 15:09.270
Where do you live?

15:09.270 --> 15:10.720
Live?

15:10.720 --> 15:12.740
Do you have any family?

15:13.390 --> 15:16.890
<b>He had lost most of his memories</b>

15:16.890 --> 15:18.780
What is your name?

15:19.480 --> 15:23.200
My name? My name is...

15:26.870 --> 15:29.570
M...Ro...Ck?

15:29.570 --> 15:33.070
<b>No longer did the sins
 of his past torment him</b>

15:33.070 --> 15:34.780
Morock?

15:34.780 --> 15:36.580
Molock?

15:37.280 --> 15:39.580
Morlock...

15:45.090 --> 15:49.420
<b>No longer could 
he recall his daughter's smile</b>

15:51.910 --> 15:53.540
Morlock-san...

15:53.540 --> 15:58.400
it was you who called me 
to this world, wasn't it?

16:00.140 --> 16:03.650
The one who called Saitou 
to this world was the old man?

16:13.030 --> 16:14.200
It's no good!

16:14.200 --> 16:17.040
The shield I reinforced 
with magic has begun to melt!

16:17.040 --> 16:19.510
Master, we don't have time to discuss this!

16:19.510 --> 16:20.920
To start at the conclusion,

16:20.920 --> 16:24.040
you should be able to use magic 
that controls time!

16:24.270 --> 16:26.040
B-But...

16:29.640 --> 16:32.640
I really have no memory of it.

16:32.640 --> 16:34.720
And I forget incantations.

16:35.070 --> 16:38.920
Especially ones that 
I haven't used in a while.

16:38.920 --> 16:41.640
It's all right! I remember!

16:42.310 --> 16:43.690
Saitou...

16:45.720 --> 16:50.080
The writing was difficult to read, 
so I could only memorize one, but...

16:50.940 --> 16:55.270
A Moment of Solitude. 
That's the incantation I remember.

16:55.680 --> 16:58.570
It's supposed to be magic 
that stops time for a moment.

16:58.570 --> 17:00.080
How long is "a moment"?

17:00.080 --> 17:01.720
It differs depending on the caster,

17:01.720 --> 17:04.450
but my master should be able to
buy enough time to count to a hundred.

17:04.890 --> 17:08.080
If we stop time when 
that thing's eyes are open,

17:08.080 --> 17:10.450
and hammer attack magic into the eyeballs...

17:10.450 --> 17:11.880
we may be able to defeat it!

17:12.670 --> 17:13.650
But...

17:14.230 --> 17:15.960
Saitou, I'm sorry!

17:16.220 --> 17:17.670
I can't remember.

17:17.670 --> 17:20.340
I really can't remember!

17:20.520 --> 17:23.840
I can't remember if it was 
me who summoned you.

17:25.320 --> 17:27.640
I'm sorry I made you feel distressed.

17:27.640 --> 17:29.950
Right now, just focus on the incantation.

17:31.190 --> 17:37.080
And even if it was you who called me 
to this world, Morlock-san...

17:37.080 --> 17:39.480
That doesn't change anything.

17:39.480 --> 17:40.910
Saitou...

17:46.530 --> 17:48.340
Good. In that case...

17:53.740 --> 17:56.670
<i>I shall convey the plan 
to everyone through telepathy.</i>

17:58.270 --> 18:01.440
<i>Master is about to use magic 
he's saved as a secret weapon.</i>

18:01.440 --> 18:03.360
<i>As we protect him,</i>

18:03.360 --> 18:06.090
<i>we must also avoid attacking 
the eyes as much as we can.</i>

18:06.090 --> 18:09.840
<i>We want it to keep its eyes open.</i>

18:09.840 --> 18:10.890
Understood!

18:10.890 --> 18:13.110
Honestly! You work people far too hard!

18:13.920 --> 18:16.060
Cast support magic on the vanguard!

18:16.060 --> 18:17.400
Prayer! Double Speed!

18:17.400 --> 18:19.910
Heavy Armor! Heat Resist! Lightning Resist!

18:22.120 --> 18:24.940
Act as decoys and get it 
to shoot light beams! Spread out!

18:30.570 --> 18:32.840
Start the plan!

18:33.400 --> 18:37.420
Um... What was it again?

18:37.420 --> 18:38.920
Right from the start?

18:38.920 --> 18:41.110
Take your time and repeat after me.

18:41.110 --> 18:43.850
Open, door which only exists here.

18:43.850 --> 18:46.420
Open, door which exists everywhere.

18:47.200 --> 18:50.230
Open, door which only exists here.

18:50.230 --> 18:52.950
Open, door which exists everywhere.

18:54.160 --> 18:57.530
Make it shoot light beams! 
Keep those eyes open!

18:58.030 --> 19:00.820
Raelza, protect Guivre and Ninia for me!

19:00.820 --> 19:01.960
I already am!

19:08.440 --> 19:10.630
We should cast more support magic!

19:10.630 --> 19:11.880
All right.

19:12.330 --> 19:14.690
Hey, geezer, hurry up!

19:14.690 --> 19:16.640
From far beyond to here.

19:16.640 --> 19:18.350
From here to far beyond.

19:18.640 --> 19:20.480
Break the circle of reason.

19:20.480 --> 19:23.500
With that sword which pierces the light...

19:24.170 --> 19:25.340
The light...

19:25.340 --> 19:29.220
A blink is an eternity, 
an eternity is the briefest of moments.

19:29.570 --> 19:34.240
A-A blink is an eternity, 
an eternity is the briefest of moments!

19:40.010 --> 19:41.360
What is this pressure?

19:41.770 --> 19:43.320
That ninja and his allies...

19:43.320 --> 19:47.360
What were they trying to do that 
they would turn themselves into this?

19:53.450 --> 19:54.420
This is bad!

20:02.140 --> 20:02.840
Crap!

20:02.840 --> 20:04.570
Saitou! Don't!

20:04.570 --> 20:06.050
You won't be able to hold it back!

20:10.000 --> 20:11.430
It-It's no good!

20:11.430 --> 20:12.200
This is where...

20:12.200 --> 20:13.560
you leave it to us!

20:14.650 --> 20:17.030
The hero! And Monpui-san!

20:20.440 --> 20:23.660
<b>Idol Magician Rychee made a shield just big enough for herself!!</b>

20:26.950 --> 20:28.440
Master Saitou!

20:28.440 --> 20:31.320
In spite of everything, 
we are still the hero's party!

20:31.320 --> 20:33.200
Thank you, Monpui-san!

20:37.560 --> 20:39.660
Morlock-san, keep going.

20:43.670 --> 20:47.840
The blade thrown into the great, 
rushing flow of time...

20:48.300 --> 20:49.930
disturbs the water's surface!

21:08.950 --> 21:10.710
Those ripples it gave rise to...

21:10.710 --> 21:13.710
Those ripples it gave rise 
to shall serve as guides.

21:14.040 --> 21:15.450
<i>Just one more passage!</i>

21:15.450 --> 21:18.370
Guide me and me alone...

21:18.370 --> 21:20.470
to a Moment of Solitude!

21:45.280 --> 21:48.490
<b>Time stopped for everyone but Morlock</b>

21:48.480 --> 21:49.580
Huh?

21:51.400 --> 21:53.180
Let's see...

21:53.180 --> 21:55.940
I feel like there's 
something I'm supposed to do.

21:56.500 --> 22:01.500
<b>The Great Mage Who Forgets Everything</b>

22:01.750 --> 22:10.010
<b>Before time passes once more,</b>

22:03.800 --> 22:10.010
<b>counting to 100</b>

22:06.050 --> 22:10.010
<b>is possible</b>

22:30.240 --> 22:33.040
<i>Like being gently carried away on a current</i>

22:33.040 --> 22:35.700
<i>Like drifting off to sleep at night</i>

22:35.700 --> 22:37.950
<i>Like there's nothing 
particularly special about it</i>

22:37.950 --> 22:39.930
<i>Our hearts are one</i>

22:39.930 --> 22:42.770
<i>“See you later” illuminates the way</i>

22:42.770 --> 22:44.780
<i>To the depths of the future</i>

22:44.780 --> 22:49.660
<i>Where kindness is the one 
thing I'm certain I felt</i>

22:49.660 --> 22:54.640
<i>You know, I'm sure we 
don't know anything</i>

22:54.640 --> 22:59.590
<i>But you know, for right now, that’s fine</i>

22:59.590 --> 23:02.270
<i>I'm waiting, I'm waiting</i>

23:02.270 --> 23:04.430
<i>Let's sing here again</i>

23:04.430 --> 23:07.220
<i>One day, we'll shine the light</i>

23:07.220 --> 23:09.900
<i>Now, I think I can embrace even my tears</i>

23:09.900 --> 23:12.010
<i>As we picture it, as we paint it</i>

23:12.010 --> 23:14.150
<i>A single bit of warmth is all there is</i>

23:14.150 --> 23:20.710
<i>And now, so that we can 
laugh, let's hold hands</i>

23:20.710 --> 23:26.570
<i>That’s right, it will 
blossom in the skies</i>

23:26.570 --> 23:32.720
<i>A guidepost showing us the way to live</i>
